# LineLoom v1.1.0 GitHub pre-release publishing trigger

Approved channel: GitHub Releases PRE-RELEASE (not stable).
Version: 1.1.0
Publisher: SanskarCodes
Stable registry versions to preserve: 1.0.0 (Visual Studio Marketplace and Open VSX)
Development PR: #23 (cross-platform CI and packaged pre-release VSIX checks passed)
Published release workflow: .github/workflows/release-preview.yml

Publishing must pass the separate workflow gates (locked npm dependencies,
typechecking, lint, tests, mocked-Ollama extension host, dependency audit,
VSIX pre-release marker and checksum, and isolated VS Code CLI install).
The v1.0.0 tag and release must never be edited.
